<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P affirms AA- rating for Ontario Hydro samurais.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P affirms AA- rating for Ontario Hydro samurais.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp (S&amp;P) said on Friday that it had affirmed its AA- rating for Ontario Hydro's 50 billion yen 5.45 percent yen/Australian dollar dual-currency samurai bonds due December 7, 1999.</p>
<p>S&amp;P said in a statement that its outlook for the rating is stable.</p>
</text>
